<Legal title="Privacy Policy" updated="8 May 2026">
  <ul slot="summary" class="list-none flex flex-col gap-1 text-white text-[15px]">
    <li><span class="text-[#00e887] font-black mr-2">✓</span>We collect your email if you sign up; payment info via Gumroad if you buy.</li>
    <li><span class="text-[#00e887] font-black mr-2">✓</span>We use it for delivery, support, and occasional updates — nothing else.</li>
    <li><span class="text-[#00e887] font-black mr-2">✓</span>We don't sell your data, run ad trackers, or use tracking cookies.</li>
    <li><span class="text-[#00e887] font-black mr-2">✓</span>Email <a href="mailto:wiggjamie9@gmail.com">wiggjamie9@gmail.com</a> anytime to delete everything.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>1. What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Email address — when you join the waitlist, buy a product, or contact support</li>
    <li>Payment information — handled entirely by Gumroad; we never see your card details</li>
    <li>Renderings you create — you own them; we don't store them</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. What we use it for</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Delivering RHYTHMIX Studio to you</li>
    <li>Sending occasional product updates (always with an unsubscribe link)</li>
    <li>Customer support</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Third parties we share with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Gumroad</strong> — processes your payment and manages your customer account</li>
    <li><strong>Formsubmit</strong> — relays form submissions from the website to our inbox</li>
    <li><strong>Replicate</strong> — only used by you with your own API key; we never see your renders</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Cookies and tracking</h2>
  <p>This site does not use tracking cookies or ad networks. We don't run Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, or any third-party tracker.</p>

  <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Access</strong> — ask what we have on you</li>
    <li><strong>Delete</strong> — ask us to remove everything</li>
    <li><strong>Correct</strong> — ask us to update inaccurate data</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:wiggjamie9@gmail.com">wiggjamie9@gmail.com</a> with your request. We respond within 7 days.</p>

  <h2>6. Data retention</h2>
  <p>We keep your email until you ask us to delete it, or until you've been inactive for 5 years.</p>

  <h2>7. Children</h2>
  <p>RHYTHMIX is not directed at children under 13.</p>

  <h2>8. Changes</h2>
  <p>If we make material changes to this policy, we'll email you.</p>

  <h2>9. Jurisdiction</h2>
  <p>This privacy policy is governed by Australian law.</p>

  <h2>Questions?</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:wiggjamie9@gmail.com">wiggjamie9@gmail.com</a>.</p>

